# Cesium Ion access token (free tier — sign up at https://cesium.com/ion/signup)
# Required for Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles. Without it the app falls back
# to a procedural globe placeholder so the rest of the demo (live aircraft,
# trajectory prediction, VR) still works.
#
# IMPORTANT: this token is shipped client-side. Restrict to your domain via
# Cesium Ion dashboard → Access Tokens → Allowed URLs.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
